WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
narrator: Prepare eight synthetic audit records and an empty receipt journal.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000
narrator: Run the clean verifier, then modify only the first record while keeping valid JSON.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
narrator: Both verifications use the original HMAC key explicitly.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
narrator: Require clean exit zero, then exact exit one and a line-one MAC mismatch.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:49.000
narrator: Missing files, parse errors, and unexpected success cannot satisfy this negative control.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:52.000
narrator: Local audit checks do not prove delivery.
